//www.opentrain.ai/jobs/technical-documentation-parts-and-annotation-specialist--cmvsmbrpv002h08k32qg4hmdu/","raw_description":"The work Apply specialized professional judgment to AI training materials and turn complex source materials into accurate, structured outputs. Convert engineering drawings and bills of materials into assembly procedures with the correct order of dependencies for technical manuals. Identify and verify industrial replacement parts using photographs, nameplates, manufacturer catalogs, and distributor catalogs. Interpret production patterns, markers, and cutting-room plans for apparel or industrial fabrication. Review annotated image batches, decide whether labels are accurate, and apply project ontologies and annotation guidelines. Write clear reasons for recommendations and quality decisions to support AI model training. Refine documents, photographs, patterns, and annotation data to senior-practitioner standards, then submit accurate deliverables through digital collaboration platforms within agreed timelines. What it pays and takes The work is remote and can be done independently. Pay: $20 to $60 per hour. Time: Less than 20 hours per week. Location: Open to candidates in the countries specified for this role; it is not a worldwide listing. Language: Fluent English. Experience: At least 5 years in mechanical technical writing, industrial parts or application analysis, production pattern planning, or computer vision annotation quality assurance. Knowledge: Strong ability to interpret engineering drawings, bills of materials, technical manuals, parts catalogs, or production layouts. Skills: Experience producing structured, accurate records, reports, manuals, or quality decisions, plus analytical, visual, and spatial reasoning and clear written communication. Additional requirements: Familiarity with complex ontologies, annotation guidelines, or quality-control review environments, and the ability to work independently in a remote setting. Relevant background includes authoring assembly manuals from released drawing packages, matching worn parts to catalog records and supersessions, checking production marker details, or independently reviewing annotation batches. How it works You apply here in about two minutes and finish on the hiring platform. The next step is a short AI interview (technical roles include a coding challenge). Passing it is how you qualify for paid tasks, so take it soon after you are invited. The hiring platform&#39;s application for this job asks for your resume, your LinkedIn profile, your phone number, your location and answers to 13 screening questions. About AI training work AI training is the human work behind systems that learn from documents, images, language, and other examples. People with specialized experience are paid to review source material, make careful judgments, and help create accurate training data. OpenTrain helps people find AI training and data-labeling projects, build a profile, and apply in minutes.","raw_requirements":"Remote AI Training, Evaluation, Python, LLM Reasoning, Data Annotation","match_score":62,"is_blocked":false,"match_details":{"major":{"score":30,"status":"High Match","reason":"Sangat Cocok! Pekerjaan ini sesuai dengan latar belakang Teknik Informatika, Data, atau IT."},"gpa":{"score":12,"status":"Match","reason":"Sesuai. Tidak ada syarat IPK minimal yang tertulis secara eksplisit."},"age":{"score":8,"status":"Match","reason":"Sesuai. Tidak ada batas usia maksimal yang disebutkan secara spesifik."},"toefl":{"score":8,"status":"Match","reason":"Sesuai. Tidak ada syarat nilai TOEFL tertulis secara spesifik."},"gender":{"score":4,"status":"Match","reason":"Sesuai. Lowongan terbuka untuk Pria dan Wanita."},"skills":{"score":8,"status":"Match","reason":"Cocok. Menemukan beberapa kecocokan kata kunci keahlian: python, ai."},"experience":{"score":0,"status":"Neutral","reason":"Perlu perhatian: posisi menargetkan level Senior / pengalaman lebih dari 2 tahun."},"exp_years":{"status":"Medium Match","reason":"Perlu Perhatian: Judul posisi mengindikasikan level Senior / Lead / Manager."}},"nlp_breakdown":{"education_summary":"S1 / D3 jurusan relevan atau setara","experience_summary":"People with specialized experience are paid to review source material, make careful judgments, and help create accurate training data","mandatory_skills":["Python"],"preferred_skills":[],"soft_skills":["Analytical","Communication"],"mandatory_requirements":[],"preferred_requirements":[],"nice_to_have":[],"key_responsibilities":["People with specialized experience are paid to review source material, make careful judgments, and help create accurate training data"],"skill_categories":["Languages & Core"]},"parsed_requirements":{"gpa":null,"age":null,"toefl":null,"gender":"Open","experience":"Open / Not Specified","exp_years":0},"source":"OpenTrain.ai","logo":null},{"id":"grab_744000163612099","title":"Lead Software Engineer, Backend - Business Platform","organization_id":"Grab","organization_name":"Grab Indonesia","slug":"grab-744000163612099","type_name":"Full Time","level":"Profesional","location":"Jakarta, Indonesia","workplace":"Hybrid / WFO","due_date":"Aktif","group":"Grab Tech & Operations","url":"https://www.grab.careers/en/jobs/744000163612099/lead-software-engineer-backend-business-platform/","raw_description":"<p>Lead Software Engineer, Backend - Business Platform</p><p>Team</p><p>Engineering</p><p>Location</p><p>Jakarta, Indonesia</p><p>Job Type</p><p>Full-time</p><p>The role at a glance</p><p>Skills you need</p><p>What we offer</p><p>Life at Grab</p><p>The role at a glance</p><p>Get to know the Team</p><p>The Business Platform team at Grab focuses on empowering a diverse range of Southeast Asian merchants—from local street stalls to international franchises—by providing them with professional tools via the GrabMerchant Super App and Portal. By leveraging data from billions of monthly transactions, the team delivers insights and innovative features that enhance efficiency and customer engagement, effectively leveling the playing field for smaller businesses. Operating as a distributed team across Indonesia and Singapore, they prioritize stability and quality to directly impact merchant profitability and ensure that business owners can focus on their core operations.</p><p>Get to know the role</p><p>We are seeking talented & passionate Engineers to join our team, you will have opportunities to work on multiple backend services as well as participating in merchant immersions, talking directly to the end-users, identifying their challenges and how we can help them in their work life. It is very important that our team members to identify problems, and have the right mindset and skill sets to solve them.</p><p>The Day-to-Day Activities</p><p>End-to-End System Ownership:</p><p>Independently designs, builds, and operates high-quality software systems, ensuring they are secure, reliable, maintainable, and rigorously tested.</p><p>Architectural & Operational Excellence:</p><p>Applies advanced architectural patterns and infrastructure best practices, while maintaining accountability for post-deployment monitoring and system health.</p><p>Strategic Stakeholder Partnership:</p><p>Collaborates effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, actively contributing to the entire product lifecycle from initial design to final rollout.</p><p>Process Optimization:</p><p>Proactively identifies and implements improvements to team workflows and engineering processes to enhance overall efficiency and delivery.</p><p>Mentorship & Team Growth:</p><p>Acts as a senior leader by mentoring junior engineers and fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional development within the team.</p><p>Read more</p><p>Skills you need</p><p>What Essential Skills You Will Need</p>","raw_requirements":"","match_score":62,"is_blocked":false,"match_details":{"major":{"score":30,"status":"High Match","rea